      "content": "that actually makes me feel kind of sick lol. because i've noticed it's not just random people either... it seems almost targeted at people who are more observant or skeptical. like the people who are most likely to notice something is \"off\" are the ones being watched. can you look into whether there are any other recent trends or \"viral\" behaviors that follow this same pattern of testing public reaction to weird stimuli?",
